invariant: INV-75
file: proof/run.sh
catches: test/prove-status-check.sh
reason: launch keeps the status file an earlier run of the same harness
  left. A job that a signal ends before it writes its own status then
  reports the earlier run's 0, and a log that holds VERIFICATION
  SUCCESSFUL passes. The check writes a stale 0 for a job that kills
  itself after its verdict, and requires FAILED.

--- old
    rm -f "$LOGDIR/$name.rc"
    (
--- new
    (
